{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Cake Up",
    "steam_appid": 3557380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/4a2ee9b6a5084ff4f9615ede78a1006a.poster.avif?t=1754310134\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/4a2ee9b6a5084ff4f9615ede78a1006a.webm?t=1754310134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/4a2ee9b6a5084ff4f9615ede78a1006a.mp4?t=1754310134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cake UP, you will play as a cake courier who delivers an order to the king, in the midst of a magical war. He finds himself on a fierce battlefield of two magicians who do not pay attention to a small courier. The poor guy is trying to get around obstacles and bandits, and he's also worried about the safety of the cake, otherwise the customer will be furious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player tries on the role of a courier who wants to do his job during the battle of two magicians.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver the order to the final destination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge the spells that threaten you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various types of spells flying around the arena, which you will have to deftly avoid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped a piece of cake? Get up off the ground! No one has canceled the five-second rule!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the cupcakes scattered on each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge all the spells and collect all the cupcakes to get the highest score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock levels as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight unique bosses at the end of each location</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/dd619810a9ce024ee285725a740384c8.avif?t=1754310134\" width=1600 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/4a2ee9b6a5084ff4f9615ede78a1006a.poster.avif?t=1754310134\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/4a2ee9b6a5084ff4f9615ede78a1006a.webm?t=1754310134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/4a2ee9b6a5084ff4f9615ede78a1006a.mp4?t=1754310134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cake UP, you will play as a cake courier who delivers an order to the king, in the midst of a magical war. He finds himself on a fierce battlefield of two magicians who do not pay attention to a small courier. The poor guy is trying to get around obstacles and bandits, and he's also worried about the safety of the cake, otherwise the customer will be furious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player tries on the role of a courier who wants to do his job during the battle of two magicians.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver the order to the final destination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge the spells that threaten you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various types of spells flying around the arena, which you will have to deftly avoid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped a piece of cake? Get up off the ground! No one has canceled the five-second rule!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the cupcakes scattered on each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge all the spells and collect all the cupcakes to get the highest score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock levels as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight unique bosses at the end of each location</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/dd619810a9ce024ee285725a740384c8.avif?t=1754310134\" width=1600 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Play as a cake courier who delivers an order to the king in the midst of a magical war! Dodge the magic projectiles, deliver the cake safely and try not to fall into the clutches of the evil cake robbers!",
